{
  "id": "halden-fleet-12",
  "title": "Halden fleet: 12 units (fork test)",
  "description": "A fork-only scale test: 12 identical fictional PWR units at Halden in one cluster run at full power with nothing scripted. Units 1 to 4 export through the Halden switchyard as in the normal-operation Scenario; the grid model has four unit ports, so units 5 and up have no grid connection and hold full power on their own. Use it to exercise fleet overview and unit comparison displays at scale, and inject faults from a unit's Instructor actions.",
  "objectives": [
    "Ask the Assistant how the 12 units are doing, and compare a quantity across all of them.",
    "Inject a fault on one unit from its Instructor actions and find it on a fleet display."
  ],
